# Terraform
# State contains secrets in plaintext and must never reach a commit; provider
# binaries bloat the repo. .terraform.lock.hcl is deliberately NOT ignored — it
# is committed so CI and laptops install byte-identical providers.
.terraform/
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
